  <div class="note">
    Shoestring Catering is a low-cost, no-frills segment of Flavours Catering which is ONLY available to:
    <ul>
      <li>Student Government</li>
      <li>Residential Students & Senate</li>
      <li>Student Organizations/Groups for the enhancement of student social life on campus.</li>
    </ul>
    In order to qualify for Shoestring prices, these guidelines need to be followed:
    <ul>
      <li>Order placed at least THREE DAYS prior to the event.</li>
      <li>Food request MUST come from the Shoestring menu.</li>
      <li>All orders will be picked up at the Brickstone Grill and Eatery Pick Up Area.</li>
